# 依赖与构建产物
**/node_modules/
**/target/
**/dist/
.m2-build-cache/
output/
tmp/

# IDE 与操作系统文件
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.settings/
**/*.iml
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# 本地配置、密钥和私有开发者配置
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/application-local.properties
**/project.private.config.json
**/http-client.private.env.json
**/http-client.env.json

# 运行日志和接口响应
**/*.log
**/*.pid
**/.logs/
**/http/response/
**/http/*-response.json

# Git 元数据恢复备份仅保留在本机
.git-backups/
